281
00:23:22.943 --> 00:23:25.195
<i>at nahawa kami
bawat isa sa pamamagitan ng paniniwalang iyon.</i>

282
00:23:26.905 --> 00:23:28.156
<i>Hindi namin alam,</i>

283
00:23:28.949 --> 00:23:31.493
