434
00:38:17.628 --> 00:38:20.464
Naaalala mo rin ba kung paano ka namatay?

435
00:38:22.967 --> 00:38:25.803
Mas naiintindihan kita
simula nung nalaman ko

436
00:38:25.886 --> 00:38:28.222
