610
00:50:19.683 --> 00:50:20.600
No Suk Min ba ang tinutukoy mo?

611
00:50:20.684 --> 00:50:22.728
Paanong hindi niya alam...

612
00:50:25.397 --> 00:50:27.107
anong ginawa ni No To Kyung?

613
00:50:27.983 --> 00:50:29.401
hindi ko maintindihan.

614
00:50:41.329 --> 00:50:42.164
siguro

615
00:50:43.373 --> 00:50:44.875
Pupuntahan ba natin si Mrs. Chu?

616
00:50:59.139 --> 00:51:01.057
Nawalan ako ng nanay at anak ko.

617
00:51:02.726 --> 00:51:04.853
ikaw na lang ang natitira ko.

618
00:51:05.437 --> 00:51:07.230
Hindi naman kami close.

619
00:51:07.314 --> 00:51:09.024
hindi pa naging

620
00:51:09.775 --> 00:51:12.486
pero subukan nating magkasundo
bilang iisang pamilya ng bawat isa.

621
00:51:14.279 --> 00:51:16.823
At Austin at Justin -
ngayon ang tanging magiging tagapagmana

622
00:51:16.907 --> 00:51:18.867
"Mire Group".

623
00:51:38.678 --> 00:51:39.721
Ms. Chu.

624
00:51:41.264 --> 00:51:42.516
Ngayon tapos na ang lahat.

625
00:51:43.308 --> 00:51:44.643
Pero sa kabila nito, hindi ko nararamdaman

626
00:51:46.019 --> 00:51:47.437
