627
00:51:49.856 --> 00:51:52.317
Ngunit si To Kyung ay tumakas sa kanyang mga kasalanan.

628
00:51:53.235 --> 00:51:54.653
At naiinis pa rin ako.

629
00:51:55.946 --> 00:51:57.447
Kakayanin ko ba in time?

630
00:51:58.198 --> 00:51:59.574
